<title>USA: El Salvador cancels U.S. PL 480 tenders.</title>
<headline>El Salvador cancels U.S. PL 480 tenders.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador said it has cancelled their commodity tenders for U.S. soybean meal, vegoil and tallow under the PL 480 Title I export program.</p>
<p>&quot;They are expected to retender shortly,&quot; its U.S. shipping agent said. There was no reason given for the cancellation.</p>
<p>&quot;El Salvador will advise the trade in due course when new tenders are scheduled,&quot; the agent said in a release.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
